WEBVTT

00:01.340 --> 00:02.950
My, Lady Sariphi.

00:03.520 --> 00:06.640
What an enthusiastic reader you are.

00:07.140 --> 00:11.360
I have a lot to learn before 
I can be a great queen.

00:11.360 --> 00:14.610
Goodness. That explains your 
interest in beast history.

00:15.630 --> 00:21.010
Has your next duty as acting 
queen consort been decided yet?

00:21.010 --> 00:25.700
Good question. I wonder 
what kind of job it will be.

00:25.700 --> 00:29.410
You're always so composed, Lady Sariphi.

00:29.860 --> 00:31.620
Not really.

00:31.620 --> 00:36.610
I know I might struggle on my own, 
but I'm not alone anymore.

00:36.610 --> 00:39.550
I have you and everyone else.

00:41.120 --> 00:42.250
<i>And...</i>

00:42.780 --> 00:44.320
Sari!

00:44.610 --> 00:47.030
We thought we'd find you here!

00:47.030 --> 00:48.980
His Majesty summons you!

00:48.980 --> 00:49.930
Summons!

00:50.870 --> 00:52.270
Could it be...

00:56.750 --> 00:57.570
Your Majesty!

00:58.330 --> 00:59.380
There you are.

00:59.380 --> 01:01.440
I wish to discuss your next task.

01:01.440 --> 01:03.410
I knew it!

01:03.410 --> 01:06.080
This is not yet set in stone,

01:06.080 --> 01:09.660
but you are to visit troops 
stationed in the city of Maasya.

01:10.280 --> 01:11.260
Troops?

01:11.900 --> 01:16.750
The Maasya garrison has been away 
from Ozmargo since before your arrival.

01:17.150 --> 01:20.710
You have yet to meet 
any of them face-to-face.

01:20.710 --> 01:24.090
Then I'd better say hello and cheer them up!

01:23.720 --> 01:24.430
<b>BAM</b>

01:23.720 --> 01:24.430
<b>BAM</b>

01:24.090 --> 01:26.990
Don't worry. I can do this! 
I'll make a great first impression!

01:26.990 --> 01:28.600
I wasn't finished.

01:28.950 --> 01:31.580
I cannot accompany you on this visit.

01:31.960 --> 01:35.630
You are to travel to Maasya alone.

03:05.950 --> 03:10.960
A Sympathy Call and a Hyena Guard Captain

03:13.160 --> 03:15.140
All on my own?

03:15.140 --> 03:16.870
Naturally, I was opposed.

03:18.020 --> 03:19.380
I won't have it.

03:19.660 --> 03:21.920
I refuse to send Sariphi alone.

03:21.920 --> 03:27.360
But sire, your old friend Archduke 
Kaldos is reportedly on his death bed.

03:27.360 --> 03:29.430
You must go to him tomorrow.

03:29.430 --> 03:32.440
Then postpone Sariphi's visit.

03:32.440 --> 03:34.400
Impossible, sire.

03:34.400 --> 03:38.830
Although Maasya has long been 
lordless due to political strife,

03:38.830 --> 03:42.650
its new ruler has just recently been chosen.

03:42.920 --> 03:46.710
The appointment must be confirmed 
in the royal presence.

03:46.710 --> 03:51.490
And in the king's absence, the queen 
traditionally stands in as witness.

03:51.490 --> 03:54.210
Therefore, sire, might I suggest

03:54.620 --> 03:58.320
that you permit Lady Sariphi to 
make her own choice in this matter?

03:58.790 --> 04:02.000
There isn't much time, but this is something 
that concerns you personally.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.980
Consider your choice carefully.

04:05.540 --> 04:07.860
I'll go!

04:08.270 --> 04:10.480
I'll go to Maasya alone.

04:10.480 --> 04:12.710
I'll be fine without you, sire.

04:13.770 --> 04:17.970
So please, don't worry about me, 
and focus on what you need to do.

04:18.630 --> 04:21.720
Now that that's settled, 
I have a lot of packing to do.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.730
See you later, sire!

04:35.470 --> 04:37.780
Well then, Anubis, I leave the rest to you.

04:37.780 --> 04:39.410
As Your Majesty commands.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.500
Sariphi.

04:41.850 --> 04:44.220
Welcome back, Your Majesty.

04:44.450 --> 04:46.230
Sorry about the mess.

04:46.230 --> 04:48.220
Are you taking all of those with you?

04:48.220 --> 04:49.970
<b>STUFFED</b>

04:48.220 --> 04:49.970
<b>STUFFED</b>

04:49.970 --> 04:51.730
Well...

04:51.730 --> 04:54.100
I wanted to be ready for anything, 
but I overdid it.

04:55.020 --> 04:58.720
Forgive me, Sariphi, 
for placing this burden on you.

04:58.720 --> 05:00.500
It's no burden at all!

05:00.500 --> 05:01.760
Really, I'm fine!

05:01.760 --> 05:02.650
That's what I mean.

05:02.650 --> 05:07.120
You hide your own unease to spare me worry.

05:08.460 --> 05:10.960
I guess I can't fool you, huh?

05:11.830 --> 05:15.350
But while you're right that I'm nervous,

05:15.350 --> 05:17.540
that really isn't all I'm feeling.

05:17.540 --> 05:22.430
I've never been away from you 
for very long, you know?

05:22.430 --> 05:29.310
So how nervous this makes me just shows 
how much I've been depending on you.

05:29.820 --> 05:35.620
But if I prove that I can 
handle this job on my own,

05:35.620 --> 05:39.020
then you'll have a little 
less reason to worry,

05:39.020 --> 05:44.780
and I'll get a step closer to 
the queen I want to become.

05:45.180 --> 05:49.250
That thought makes me just 
as thrilled as I am afraid.

05:49.970 --> 05:51.210
Sariphi...

05:51.830 --> 05:55.150
You always leave me in your dust.

05:57.420 --> 06:02.000
Am I alone in feeling lonely at our parting?

06:03.380 --> 06:06.060
O-Of course I'll miss you, too!

06:06.060 --> 06:08.150
I'll be so lonely without you!

06:08.150 --> 06:09.850
You will? Then...

06:10.730 --> 06:14.470
may I take those feelings of yours with me?

06:16.280 --> 06:17.110
Yes.

06:17.880 --> 06:19.170
So will I.

06:19.840 --> 06:23.220
<i>I'll always be with you, Leonhart.</i>

06:23.220 --> 06:25.400
<i>You and your courageous heart.</i>

06:26.460 --> 06:27.310
Depart!

06:32.130 --> 06:34.650
<i>Have a safe trip, sire!</i>

06:38.010 --> 06:42.360
Huh? Mr. Chancellor? 
Aren't you going with the king?

06:42.360 --> 06:45.950
I am carrying out His Majesty's direct orders.

06:45.950 --> 06:46.880
To do what?

06:47.310 --> 06:51.860
To furnish my queen with a new guard 
before she departs the capital.

06:51.860 --> 06:56.450
They will be your sword and shield—
a new force at your command.

06:56.450 --> 06:57.800
A new force?

06:58.160 --> 07:03.300
Ordinarily, the Queen's Guard would be 
selected through rigorous screening.

07:03.300 --> 07:08.480
But as time is short, His Majesty 
made several appointments yesterday.

07:08.480 --> 07:09.520
However,

07:09.810 --> 07:16.610
he commanded that you yourself 
choose the captain, your right-hand man.

07:20.560 --> 07:22.070
No one's here.

07:22.390 --> 07:25.840
The Queen's Guard are the most 
honored of the palace troops.

07:26.220 --> 07:31.490
We would normally be inundated with 
volunteers, even on such short notice.

07:31.490 --> 07:33.550
But even at His Majesty's command,

07:33.810 --> 07:39.010
no one in this realm wishes to 
pledge loyalty and service to you.

07:39.010 --> 07:40.530
Not a single one.

07:40.990 --> 07:44.510
This is the reality of your present pli—

07:43.190 --> 07:44.510
Hey, outta my way!

07:46.960 --> 07:47.760
Mr. Chancellor!

07:48.090 --> 07:51.320
Man, how slow can you be? 
I warned you to move.

07:51.320 --> 07:53.200
Wh-Wh-Who are you?!

07:53.200 --> 07:54.930
Get off me this instant!

07:55.400 --> 07:57.270
And who might <i>you</i> be?

07:57.270 --> 07:59.610
Queen's Guard volunteer number one,

07:59.960 --> 08:02.200
from the Hyenian Autonomous District.

08:02.430 --> 08:04.560
Lanteveldt, at your service.

08:05.170 --> 08:07.590
Lanteveldt the Hyenian?

08:07.590 --> 08:09.550
Hello. I'm Sariphi.

08:09.550 --> 08:10.570
It's so nice to—

08:10.570 --> 08:11.630
Wait, girl.

08:12.080 --> 08:15.510
I am under no obligation 
whatsoever to advise you,

08:15.510 --> 08:18.730
but choose your right-hand man more carefully.

08:18.730 --> 08:23.060
This fellow lacks even the most basic 
courtesy expected of a palace guard.

08:23.280 --> 08:25.250
And he is Hyenian to boot!

08:25.250 --> 08:30.140
But no one else wants to guard me, right?

08:30.140 --> 08:32.540
You just said so yourself.

08:32.530 --> 08:33.860
<b>He said it.</b>

08:32.530 --> 08:33.860
<b>He said it.</b>

08:33.190 --> 08:34.410
True...

08:34.410 --> 08:37.070
But at least test his skill 
in combat before you—

08:39.540 --> 08:41.830
Do you ever shut up?

08:41.830 --> 08:45.060
Maybe I should show off my skills on <i>you</i>.

08:45.060 --> 08:46.450
Arrogant whelp...

08:46.450 --> 08:50.010
Okay, that's enough! 
I can see that you're strong.

08:51.060 --> 08:54.750
I hereby name you captain of the 
acting queen's personal guard.

08:54.750 --> 08:56.900
Nice to meet you, Lanteveldt.

09:00.280 --> 09:02.700
Sure. It's my pleasure.

09:05.390 --> 09:08.030
Ugh! This thing is so stuffy.

09:08.030 --> 09:11.250
I don't need any fancy uniform.

09:11.540 --> 09:13.880
But you look so good in it, Lanteveldt.

09:13.880 --> 09:16.120
Um... Can I call you Lante?

09:16.120 --> 09:18.030
Suit yourself.

09:18.030 --> 09:24.060
Anyway, a sympathy call isn't much 
of a first mission as your guard captain.

09:24.740 --> 09:26.890
Where are your manners?!

09:26.890 --> 09:28.670
And then there's this carriage.

09:29.250 --> 09:33.070
Driver, turn southwest at the next fork!

09:33.070 --> 09:37.040
What?! B-But we must keep 
to our prescribed route...

09:37.040 --> 09:39.230
The sun'll set on us if we do that.

09:39.230 --> 09:41.450
This is a shortcut, so get a move on!

09:41.450 --> 09:42.750
Y-Yes, sir!

09:44.300 --> 09:49.440
So, Lante, why did you 
volunteer for my guard?

09:50.080 --> 09:51.140
Promotion.

09:51.510 --> 09:52.970
Promotion?

09:53.420 --> 09:58.020
Being a palace guard at all is a 
pretty high rank for a commoner.

09:58.440 --> 10:02.280
Jumping straight to captain of the 
Queen's Guard is normally impossible.

10:02.930 --> 10:08.200
But I figured there wouldn't be 
much competition for this one.

10:08.610 --> 10:11.790
Still can't believe I was 
the only volunteer, though.

10:11.790 --> 10:15.430
I sure am lucky you're human.

10:18.120 --> 10:19.460
L-Look!

10:20.680 --> 10:22.040
S-Sand serpents!

10:22.040 --> 10:24.530
So many! Do they nest here?!

10:24.530 --> 10:25.690
Oh, no!

10:35.440 --> 10:36.710
Clops!

10:37.560 --> 10:38.690
No!

10:39.520 --> 10:40.540
Hold it.

10:40.540 --> 10:42.490
C-Captain Lanteveldt?!

10:42.740 --> 10:44.410
Why do you delay?!

10:44.410 --> 10:46.630
Unless we act quickly, it will be too—

10:45.770 --> 10:47.520
<i>I'm</i> in command here.

10:47.880 --> 10:49.420
You wait when I tell you to.

10:50.910 --> 10:52.000
Clops!

11:13.390 --> 11:14.670
Lante...

11:21.100 --> 11:25.210
I... I don't believe it. 
He killed all those sand serpents

11:25.210 --> 11:26.690
single-handedly?

11:27.720 --> 11:29.330
I'm glad you're not hurt,

11:30.160 --> 11:31.770
Your Acting Majesty.

11:33.280 --> 11:37.170
Captain! What was the meaning 
of your orders just now?!

11:37.170 --> 11:40.860
One wrong move, and that would 
have ended in disaster!

11:41.480 --> 11:45.120
Oh, pipe down. I didn't slip up, 
so what's the problem?

11:45.120 --> 11:45.910
What?!

11:45.910 --> 11:49.250
Respectfully, sir, you changed 
our course on a whim.

11:49.250 --> 11:52.460
It's your fault that we stumbled 
into that den of sand serpents.

11:52.460 --> 11:54.060
Or could it be

11:54.060 --> 11:57.150
that you led us there deliberately?!

11:57.150 --> 12:00.860
Y-You must be after the acting queen's life!

12:00.860 --> 12:04.270
I knew we should never have 
trusted a Hyenian in the first—

12:03.560 --> 12:04.820
Wait!

12:06.340 --> 12:10.780
We all made it out safely, so please, 
don't fight among yourselves.

12:10.780 --> 12:13.830
Him, one of us? Don't make me laugh.

12:13.830 --> 12:16.170
I can't believe I have to 
take orders from this pup.

12:16.600 --> 12:18.470
If I may speak my mind,

12:18.470 --> 12:22.170
I would not guard a human, either, 
if His Majesty had not commanded it.

12:22.400 --> 12:25.200
You said it. We really drew the short straw.

12:26.850 --> 12:29.090
Aren't you suspicious, too?

12:29.580 --> 12:33.050
Don't you wanna know if I led you 
to those serpents on purpose?

12:33.610 --> 12:37.820
I'm not sure. I don't know you 
well enough to doubt you.

12:38.200 --> 12:41.510
Yeah? So you'll doubt me once 
you get to know me better?

12:43.120 --> 12:44.730
About earlier...

12:45.240 --> 12:50.430
They're half right. I did send 
you that way on purpose.

12:51.360 --> 12:55.330
Wh-Why?! Don't tell me you 
really do want Sari dead?!

12:55.550 --> 12:58.050
To make a name for myself.

12:58.050 --> 13:01.330
Getting you through that safely 
oughta be a feather in my cap.

13:01.330 --> 13:02.520
What?!

13:02.520 --> 13:06.760
If you died, I'd lose my head, 
not to mention my job.

13:06.760 --> 13:12.340
I promise I'll keep you alive, so put in 
a good word for me with the king.

13:12.340 --> 13:15.580
We won't let you off the hook that easily!

13:15.580 --> 13:16.290
Won't!

13:16.290 --> 13:18.560
First of all, how can we possibly trust—

13:18.560 --> 13:19.240
All right.

13:19.240 --> 13:20.230
What?!

13:20.850 --> 13:24.700
My safety is in your hands. 
I'm counting on you.

13:26.030 --> 13:30.170
S-Sari?! Did you forget how much 
danger you were just in?!

13:30.170 --> 13:31.630
Well, he <i>did</i> save me.

13:31.630 --> 13:35.150
If not for him, you wouldn't 
have needed saving!

13:35.150 --> 13:38.970
But we might still have run into 
trouble on our original route.

13:39.990 --> 13:40.880
But...

13:41.200 --> 13:44.760
Still, Lante, I want you 
to promise me one thing.

13:45.330 --> 13:48.840
You're free to use me to 
make a name for yourself,

13:49.250 --> 13:53.150
but never put anyone else in danger again.

13:53.150 --> 13:56.490
Protecting me should earn you 
all the prestige you need.

13:58.020 --> 13:59.470
Sari...

13:59.470 --> 14:00.850
I'm surprised.

14:01.460 --> 14:03.020
Are you like this with everyone?

14:04.480 --> 14:07.950
I'd say people like you are 
the least trustworthy of all.

14:08.430 --> 14:10.340
Still, I'll give you my word.

14:10.340 --> 14:13.170
And I'll take you up on 
that offer to use you,

14:13.420 --> 14:14.920
Your Acting Majesty.

14:17.480 --> 14:20.360
The acting queen consort has arrived!

14:21.700 --> 14:23.640
Sh-She really is human.

14:23.640 --> 14:26.890
And look there. A Hyenian.

14:26.890 --> 14:29.550
What is one of <i>them</i> doing here?

14:31.570 --> 14:34.180
Hey, you old-timers there.

14:34.450 --> 14:36.020
O-Old—

14:36.020 --> 14:38.810
If you've got something to say, 
say it to my face.

14:38.810 --> 14:39.910
You're creeping me out.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.650
Wh-What impudence!

14:41.650 --> 14:46.000
You're the impudent one here. 
I'm the captain of the Queen's Guard.

14:46.000 --> 14:47.870
You?! Impossible!

14:48.550 --> 14:53.820
I outrank common soldiers like you, 
so watch your tongue.

14:53.820 --> 14:55.480
What was that?!

14:55.480 --> 14:56.400
Why, you...

14:56.400 --> 14:57.470
Lante, please...

14:57.470 --> 14:59.580
You there! What's all this commotion?

14:59.580 --> 15:01.240
C-Captain Teiryn!

15:01.240 --> 15:04.100
Cut the chitchat and return to your posts.

15:04.100 --> 15:05.460
Y-Yes, sir!

15:05.940 --> 15:08.540
My humble apologies, Acting Queen Consort.

15:09.010 --> 15:12.180
I am Teiryn, commander 
of the Maasya garrison.

15:12.520 --> 15:14.450
Pleased to meet you. I'm Sariphi—

15:14.450 --> 15:17.390
I realize that you must be 
fatigued from your journey,

15:17.390 --> 15:20.820
but would you kindly address 
the troops at once?

15:21.110 --> 15:24.690
We haven't much time, 
so please make it brief.

15:25.590 --> 15:27.790
He creeps me out, too.

15:34.270 --> 15:36.580
I have second-hand stage fright.

15:36.580 --> 15:37.920
Good luck, Sari!

15:46.680 --> 15:48.210
<i>So many people.</i>

15:48.770 --> 15:50.800
<i>So many doubtful looks.</i>

15:50.800 --> 15:52.720
<i>That's nothing new, but...</i>

16:03.820 --> 16:06.610
Hello, everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you.

16:08.770 --> 16:10.040
Hello!

16:10.650 --> 16:13.100
H-He...llo.

16:14.260 --> 16:19.560
I know a human girl dropping in out 
of the blue must be confusing for you,

16:19.560 --> 16:23.770
but I really am Acting Queen Consort Sariphi.

16:23.770 --> 16:24.910
That's her?

16:24.910 --> 16:26.580
It's true, then.

16:26.580 --> 16:27.810
Silence!

16:28.270 --> 16:32.760
His Majesty, the king of Ozmargo, 
gave me a message for you all.

16:33.320 --> 16:39.450
"Your service is still needed to preserve 
the peace and stability of Maasya.

16:39.450 --> 16:43.930
Be aware—and proud—of your 
roles as soldiers of Ozmargo.

16:44.180 --> 16:48.010
I wish you to do your duty each day 
with mental and physical discipline."

16:49.250 --> 16:51.400
Those were His Majesty's words.

16:51.860 --> 16:55.370
Please, lend your support to our king.

16:59.010 --> 17:01.610
Great job, Sari!

17:01.610 --> 17:03.150
Was that really a good idea?

17:03.410 --> 17:05.790
Huh? Did I do something wrong?

17:05.790 --> 17:08.650
You didn't need to come 
over all humble like that.

17:08.650 --> 17:11.280
You're the highest-ranking person here.

17:11.280 --> 17:13.370
Oh, I don't think I'm that important.

17:13.370 --> 17:15.490
There! That's what I'm talking about!

17:15.490 --> 17:19.800
How am I supposed to trust somebody 
who doesn't like being in charge?!

17:20.090 --> 17:21.430
It's ridiculous!

17:23.020 --> 17:24.390
Acting Queen Consort,

17:24.770 --> 17:29.200
it is my honor to have been named 
the present lord of Maasya.

17:29.200 --> 17:35.240
Braun is my name, and I have 
eagerly awaited your arrival.

17:35.240 --> 17:41.440
We can hold the signing ceremony 
first thing tomorrow morning.

17:41.720 --> 17:43.810
Is it that urgent?

17:43.810 --> 17:48.320
This land once permitted an 
anti-monarchist insurgency,

17:48.320 --> 17:52.770
and our extended lack of a lord 
has prolonged the chaos.

17:53.050 --> 17:56.020
Once the signing ceremony 
is complete, however,

17:56.020 --> 17:59.900
even the rebel remnants should 
settle down somewhat.

18:01.710 --> 18:03.570
Anti-monarchists, huh?

18:04.090 --> 18:08.170
I've read about them, 
but they've never felt real before.

18:08.170 --> 18:10.190
But they're always a minority.

18:10.530 --> 18:12.820
You don't need to worry about them!

18:12.820 --> 18:14.670
I hope you're right.

18:15.630 --> 18:16.530
That reminds me!

18:16.770 --> 18:19.940
Didn't Lante say he was going 
to stand guard in the corridor?

18:20.620 --> 18:23.210
Do you think he'll be cold 
without a blanket?

18:23.210 --> 18:24.770
Forget about him!

18:24.770 --> 18:28.940
I bet he only said that as an 
excuse to go slack off again!

18:28.940 --> 18:29.860
Again!

18:29.860 --> 18:31.270
There you go again.

18:33.370 --> 18:34.530
Lante?

18:36.640 --> 18:39.860
I already told you, I'm not plotting anything.

18:39.860 --> 18:41.880
Quit it with the false accusations, would you?

18:41.880 --> 18:46.990
Like we'd believe <i>you</i>! A Hyenian, 
captain of the Queen's Guard?!

18:46.990 --> 18:52.310
Sure you're not an anti-monarchist 
out to stop the signing ceremony?

18:52.610 --> 18:55.520
If I tried that, I could kiss 
my career goodbye.

18:56.010 --> 18:58.460
I side with the powerful.

18:58.460 --> 19:01.240
Now, show some proof or shut up.

19:01.690 --> 19:06.490
You're a Hyenian! 
That's all the proof we need!

19:07.210 --> 19:10.680
We're soldiers of Ozmargo, 
sworn to the king's service!

19:10.680 --> 19:14.500
We can't overlook anyone 
who might threaten him!

19:14.850 --> 19:17.270
Oh, okay. Have it your way, then.

19:17.750 --> 19:20.170
If you stand in the way of my success,

19:20.610 --> 19:22.170
I won't hold back.

19:24.340 --> 19:26.120
Yowch!

19:26.120 --> 19:27.770
What'd you do that for, you moron?!

19:28.090 --> 19:29.860
That's what I want to know!

19:30.100 --> 19:32.450
What are you doing out here 
in the middle of the night?

19:32.450 --> 19:33.690
And that goes for you, too!

19:33.690 --> 19:36.730
A-Acting Queen, w-we were, um...

19:36.730 --> 19:42.690
We were questioning a suspicious person, 
as is our duty as Ozmargan soldiers.

19:42.690 --> 19:45.260
What's so suspicious about Lante?

19:45.260 --> 19:48.590
I won't have you insulting 
the captain of my guard.

19:49.120 --> 19:56.010
With all due respect, being human, 
you must not be aware of beast history.

19:56.010 --> 19:57.870
You see, the Hyenians—

19:57.870 --> 19:58.740
I know.

19:59.520 --> 20:04.290
They once betrayed the Royal House of 
Ozmargo and sided with an enemy nation.

20:05.480 --> 20:10.370
But that was all a long, long, <i>long</i> time ago.

20:10.750 --> 20:12.870
What does it have to do with Lante?

20:12.870 --> 20:14.400
W-Well...

20:14.400 --> 20:18.770
S-Some Hyenians now side 
with the anti-monarchists.

20:18.770 --> 20:20.360
Can you prove that Lante is one of them?

20:21.220 --> 20:23.740
Understood, Acting Queen Consort.

20:23.740 --> 20:27.830
I admit that we were in the wrong. 
We beg your pardon.

20:28.110 --> 20:30.990
But let me leave you with a word of warning.

20:31.280 --> 20:37.080
We trust you as little 
as we trust that Hyenian.

20:40.470 --> 20:42.890
I knew I couldn't trust you.

20:43.450 --> 20:48.130
You said you didn't know me well enough 
to doubt me, but you knew everything.

20:49.110 --> 20:53.160
I only read about your people in books.

20:53.160 --> 20:56.760
That's not enough to understand <i>you</i>, is it?

20:59.860 --> 21:02.830
All right, then. I'll tell you about me.

21:02.830 --> 21:03.430
Huh?

21:04.430 --> 21:09.530
Under the last king, my folks were 
executed for a crime they didn't commit.

21:10.100 --> 21:15.860
I swore to wipe out the royal family in 
revenge, so I became a palace guard.

21:15.860 --> 21:17.010
What?!

21:17.010 --> 21:19.450
H-How could you?!

21:19.450 --> 21:21.110
I'm lying, morons!

21:21.110 --> 21:25.080
I never knew my dad, 
and my mom died of illness.

21:25.630 --> 21:30.200
And since I can lie with a straight face, 
you'd be smart not to trust me much.

21:31.650 --> 21:36.720
That's funny. You look 
incredibly honest to me.

21:38.320 --> 21:42.630
I mean, just now and when you 
picked that dangerous road,

21:42.630 --> 21:45.020
you told the truth eventually.

21:45.710 --> 21:52.490
I just know you can't fool people with a 
clear conscience. You're not the type.

21:52.490 --> 21:55.440
So I'll trust you.

21:56.980 --> 22:00.260
Yeah? Suit yourself.

22:00.880 --> 22:03.340
But you'd better get back 
to your room and turn in.

22:03.340 --> 22:06.350
Oh, you're right! I'd hate to oversleep!

22:06.350 --> 22:08.160
I'll be back later.

22:08.160 --> 22:08.800
Okay.

22:09.130 --> 22:11.980
Thank you, Lante. Goodnight.

22:16.990 --> 22:18.570
<i>I'll trust you.</i>

22:22.540 --> 22:23.790
Idiot.

22:24.490 --> 22:27.730
You expect me to believe that?

22:32.390 --> 22:33.960
Good morning, Lante.

22:35.630 --> 22:36.710
His blanket...

22:36.710 --> 22:38.980
It doesn't look like he used it.

22:38.980 --> 22:41.930
H-Help! Is anyone there?!

22:42.810 --> 22:46.100
Someone attacked Lord Braun!

23:26.440 --> 23:28.850
Huh? I'm doing the preview?

23:28.850 --> 23:29.660
Well, whatever.

23:29.660 --> 23:32.610
You there, Hyenian! 
What are you doing in my spot?!

23:32.610 --> 23:35.250
Climbing the ranks. 
They say you're out of a job.

23:35.250 --> 23:35.800
Huh?

23:36.320 --> 23:38.060
What?!

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
Next Episode

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
A False Charge and a Lonely Hyena
